---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Badge from '../../components/Badge.astro';
import data from '../../data/fares.json';
import sakura from '../../data/sakura.json';
import budget from '../../data/budget.json';
const items = [...data.passes.map((p) => ({ name: p.name, value: p.priceOfficialSite, c: p.confidence, sources: p.sources, note: p.priceNote })),
  ...data.routes.map((r) => ({ name: r.name, value: r.fare, c: r.confidence, sources: r.sources, note: r.note }))];
---
<Base title="資料來源與查核日期" description="本站所有票價的來源連結、可信度與查核日期。" breadcrumbs={[{ name: '資料來源', path: '/japan/sources/' }]}>
  <h1>資料來源與查核日期</h1>
  <p>最近一次查核：<strong>{data.checked}</strong>（Asia/Taipei）。金額為日圓、成人、單程、普通車指定席、一般期，另有註明者除外。</p>
  <ul>
    <li><Badge c="official" />：取自 JR 官方頁面。</li>
    <li><Badge c="secondary" />：取自第三方網站，多個來源一致時採用；有落差時取較低值並註明。</li>
    <li><Badge c="unknown" />：查不到可靠數字，試算器中留空讓使用者自行填入。</li>
  </ul>
  <div class="table-scroll">
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>項目</th><th class="num">金額</th><th>可信度</th><th>來源／備註</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        {items.map((i) => (
          <tr><td>{i.name}</td><td class="num">{i.value == null ? '待確認' : '¥' + i.value.toLocaleString('en-US')}</td><td><Badge c={i.c as any} /></td>
          <td>{i.sources.map((s) => <><a href={s.url} rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">{s.label}</a><br /></>)}<span class="meta">{i.note}</span></td></tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <h2>櫻花平年值與近年實際日期</h2>
  <p>查核日 {sakura.checked}。平年值＝1991–2020 年平均；詳細表格見 <a href="/japan/sakura/2027/">2027 櫻花時程表</a>。</p>
  <div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>城市</th><th>可信度</th><th>來源</th></tr></thead><tbody>
    {sakura.cities.map((c) => <tr><td>{c.name}</td><td><Badge c={c.confidence as any} /></td><td>{c.sources.map((s) => <><a href={s.url} rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">{s.label}</a><br /></>)}</td></tr>)}
  </tbody></table></div>
  <h2>預算計算機</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>預設匯率 {budget.fx.jpyToTwd}（{budget.fx.type}，{budget.fx.date}）：<a href={budget.fx.source.url} rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">{budget.fx.source.label}</a> <Badge c={budget.fx.confidence as any} /></li>
    <li>台灣旅客每人旅行支出 ¥{budget.reference.taiwanPerPersonJpy.toLocaleString('en-US')}（{budget.reference.year}）：{budget.reference.sources.map((s) => <><a href={s.url} rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">{s.label}</a>　</>)} <Badge c={budget.reference.confidence as any} /></li>
  </ul>
  <p>發現錯誤或價格更新？本站會定期重新查核並更新此頁。</p>
</Base>
